==English==

===Etymology===
From {{m|en|Utopia}}, a term coined by Sir [[w:Thomas More|Thomas More]] in his work of the same title, from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{m|grc|οὐ||not, no}} + {{m|grc|τόπος||place}}.

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# [[ideal|Ideal]] but often [[impractical]]; [[visionary]].
#: ''a '''utopian''' project''
# of or pertaining to or resembling a utopia
#: '''''utopian''' happiness''

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|unrealistic}}

